<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Teams Copilot | TUV Rheinland</title><style>:root{--bg:#06080D;--sur:#0A0F18;--b:#0071B9;--t:#E8ECF1;--m:#6B7B8D;--br:rgba(107,123,141,.15);--g:#00C896;--r:#FF6478}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--t);font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.6}.a{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 20px}hdr{text-align:center;margin-bottom:50px}.tag{display:inline-block;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:.7em;background:rgba(0,152,240,.12);color:#0098F0;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:14px}hdr h1{font-size:2.2em;font-weight:300}hdr h1 b{color:#0098F0;font-weight:700}.sub{color:var(--m);font-size:.82em;margin-top:8px}.hero{border:1px solid var(--br);border-radius:18px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:40px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,113,185,.06),rgba(0,152,240,.02))}.vs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center}.old,.new{padding:20px;border-radius:12px}.old{background:rgba(255,100,120,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,100,120,.12)}.new{background:rgba(0,200,150,.05);border:1px solid rgba(0,200,150,.12)}.arr{font-size:1.8em;color:#0098F0;text-align:center}.old h3{color:var(--r)}.new h3{color:var(--g)}.hero ul{list-style:none;font-size:.78em;color:var(--m)}.hero li{padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.02)}.hero .old li:before{content:'x ';color:var(--r)}.hero .new li:before{content:'+ ';color:var(--g)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:40px}.card{background:var(--sur);border:1px solid var(--br);border-radius:14px;padding:24px}.card:hover{border-color:rgba(0,113,185,.25)}.ic{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:1.2em}.ic-f{background:rgba(0,152,240,.1);color:#0098F0}.ic-i{background:rgba(0,200,150,.1);color:var(--g)}.ic-r{background:rgba(240,160,48,.1);color:#F0A030}.card h3{font-size:1.05em;margin-bottom:6px}.csub{font-size:.68em;color:#0098F0;margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:1px}.card ul{list-style:none;font-size:.76em;color:var(--m)}.card li{padding:4px 0;padding-left:14px;position:relative}.card li:before{content:'>';position:absolute;left:0;color:#0098F0;font-size:.7em}.sec{margin-bottom:48px}.st{font-size:1.35em;font-weight:300;margin-bottom:5px}.st b{color:#0098F0;font-weight:700}.ssub{color:var(--m);font-size:.78em;margin-bottom:20px}.fd{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-bottom:28px}.fdl,.fdr{background:var(--sur);border:1px solid var(--br);border-radius:14px;padding:28px}.fdl h3{font-size:1.05em;margin-bottom:14px}.fdl ul{list-style:none;font-size:.78em;color:var(--m)}.fdl li{padding:6px 0;padding-left:18px;position:relative;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.02)}.fdl li:before{content:'>';position:absolute;left:0;color:#0098F0}.fdr h4{color:#0098F0;font-size:.7em;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:10px}.ss{padding:7px 10px;background:rgba(10,15,24,.8);border-radius:7px;font-size:.74em;color:var(--m);margin-bottom:6px}.ss b{color:#0098F0}.pb{background:rgba(0,200,150,.03);border:1px solid rgba(0,200,150,.15);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin:8px 0}.pb p{font-size:.8em;color:var(--g);font-style:italic}.q{border-left:3px solid var(--b);border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:16px 20px;background:rgba(0,113,185,.05);margin:20px 0;font-size:.84em}.warn{background:rgba(255,100,120,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,100,120,.12);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px}.warn h4{color:var(--r);font-size:.74em;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:10px}.warn ul{list-style:none;font-size:.76em;color:var(--m)}.warn li{padding:4px 0;padding-left:14px;position:relative}.warn li:before{content:'!';position:absolute;left:0;color:#F0A030}.end{text-align:center;padding:50px 0}.ad{font-size:1.8em;color:#0098F0;margin:16px 0}.big{font-size:1.3em;font-weight:300;line-height:1.6}.big b{color:var(--g);font-weight:700}footer{text-align:center;padding:32px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--br);color:var(--m);font-size:.74em;margin-top:40px}footer .brand{color:#0098F0;font-weight:600}@media(max-width:768px){.grid,.fd,.vs{grid-template-columns:1fr}.arr{transform:rotate(90deg)}hdr h1{font-size:1.5em}}</style></head><body><div class="a">
<hdr><div class="tag">INTELLIGENCE REPORT</div><h1><b>Microsoft Teams Copilot</b><br>Redefining Intelligent Meetings</h1><p class="sub">Official Demo Video (12:04) | TUV Rheinland BS.A West · 2026</p></hdr>
<div class="hero"><div class="vs">
<div class="old"><h3>Traditional Meetings</h3><ul><li>Simultaneously listen, take notes, think</li><li>Key information easily missed</li><li>Absentees left in the dark</li><li>Cross-language communication barriers</li><li>Manual follow-up tracking</li></ul></div>
<div class="arr">&rarr;</div>
<div class="new"><h3>Copilot Meetings</h3><ul><li>AI understands discussion in real-time</li><li>Auto-captures key information</li><li>One-click catch-up for absentees</li><li>Real-time bidirectional interpretation</li><li>Structured decisions + action tracking</li></ul></div>
</div></div>
<div class="q">Copilot transforms meetings from conversations into <b>structured organizational knowledge</b>.</div>
<div class="sec"><div class="st"><b>Copilot Meeting Intelligence</b> — Capability Overview</div><div class="ssub">Three pillars covering the full meeting lifecycle</div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><div class="ic ic-f">&gt;</div><div class="csub">DURING MEETING</div><h3>Facilitator</h3><ul><li>AI real-time meeting assistant</li><li>Understands topics, views, direction</li><li>Converts discussion to structured knowledge</li><li>Topic &rarr; Discussion &rarr; Decision &rarr; Action</li><li>Background operation, non-disruptive</li></ul></div>
<div class="card"><div class="ic ic-i">&harr;</div><div class="csub">COMMUNICATION</div><h3>Interpreter</h3><ul><li>AI real-time bidirectional interpretation</li><li>Chinese · German · French · Italian · Japanese</li><li>Bidirectional, real-time, zero latency</li><li>Speaker &rarr; Copilot &rarr; Listener</li><li>Seamless cross-language teamwork</li></ul></div>
<div class="card"><div class="ic ic-r">&starf;</div><div class="csub">AFTER MEETING</div><h3>Recap + Audio</h3><ul><li>Meeting Summary — topics &amp; discussions</li><li>Decisions — what was finalized</li><li>Action Items — What · Who · Next</li><li>Ask Copilot — natural language Q&amp;A</li><li>Audio Recap — listen on the go</li></ul></div>
</div></div>
<div class="sec"><div class="st">01 / <b>Facilitator</b></div><div class="ssub">AI Real-Time Meeting Assistant · ~00:40—05:20</div>
<div class="fd">
<div class="fdl"><h3>How It Works</h3><ul><li>Meeting Options &rarr; Turn on Facilitator &rarr; Start Meeting &rarr; Copilot joins</li><li>Real-time comprehension: current topic, viewpoints, discussion direction</li><li>Meeting organization: Topic &rarr; Discussion &rarr; Decision &rarr; Action</li><li>AI manages meeting knowledge instead of humans taking notes</li></ul></div>
<div class="fdr"><h4>SCREENSHOT GUIDE</h4><div class="ss"><b>Screenshot 1</b> — Facilitator ON in Meeting Options</div><div class="ss"><b>Screenshot 2</b> — Facilitator running during meeting</div><div class="ss"><b>Screenshot 3</b> — Structured meeting view: Topic/Decision/Action</div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="sec"><div class="st">02 / <b>Interpreter</b></div><div class="ssub">AI Real-Time Bidirectional Interpretation · Starts 05:29</div>
<div class="fd">
<div class="fdl"><h3>How It Works</h3><ul><li>Meeting Controls &rarr; Language &rarr; Turn on Interpreter &rarr; Select Language</li><li>English &rarr; Copilot &rarr; Italian output / Reverse direction</li><li>Supports: Chinese · German · French · Italian · Japanese</li><li>Traditional: Speaker &rarr; Human Interpreter &rarr; Audience</li><li>AI: Speaker &rarr; Copilot Interpreter &rarr; Listener</li></ul></div>
<div class="fdr"><h4>SCREENSHOT GUIDE</h4><div class="ss"><b>Screenshot 4</b> — Interpreter settings: Language and Speech</div><div class="ss"><b>Screenshot 5</b> — Language selection dropdown</div><div class="ss"><b>Screenshot 6</b> — Interpreter running (bilingual display)</div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="sec"><div class="st">03 / <b>Recap + Ask Copilot + Audio Recap</b></div><div class="ssub">Post-Meeting Intelligence · Starts 07:36</div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>Meeting Recap</h3><ul><li>Summary — meeting topics &amp; core discussions</li><li>Key Topics — scope at a glance</li><li>Decisions — what was finalized</li><li>Action Items — What · Who · Next Step</li></ul><div class="ss" style="margin-top:14px"><b>Screenshot 7</b> — Recap page full view</div></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Ask Copilot</h3><ul><li>Natural language meeting Q&amp;A</li><li>Based on Transcript + Context</li><li>Outputs structured answers</li></ul><div class="pb"><p>"What happened in this meeting?"</p></div><div class="pb"><p>"What decisions were made?"</p></div><div class="pb"><p>"What actions do I need to take?"</p></div></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Audio Recap</h3><ul><li>Meeting &rarr; AI Analysis &rarr; Audio Overview</li><li>Commute · mobile office · quick catch-up</li><li>Listen to meeting summary — no reading required</li></ul><div class="ss" style="margin-top:14px"><b>Screenshot 8</b> — Audio Recap playback interface</div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="sec"><div class="st">04 / <b>Enterprise Extensions</b></div><div class="ssub">Content not covered in video — recommended training supplements</div>
<div class="warn"><h4>RECOMMENDED ADDITIONS</h4><ul><li><b>License Requirements</b> — Microsoft 365 Copilot License · Teams version prerequisites</li><li><b>Security &amp; Privacy</b> — Data security · Permission management · Microsoft Graph integration</li><li><b>Knowledge Management</b> — Meeting Knowledge &rarr; SharePoint &rarr; Microsoft Graph &rarr; Copilot closed loop</li></ul></div></div>
<div class="end">
<div class="big"><b>Past</b><br>People + Meeting Room + Notes<br><span class="ad">&darr;</span><br><b>Future</b><br>People + AI Meeting Assistant<br>+ Organizational Memory<br>+ Action Intelligence</div>
<div class="q" style="margin-top:28px">Conversation &rarr; Understanding &rarr; Knowledge &rarr; Action</div>
</div>
<footer><p><span class="brand">TUV Rheinland BS.A West</span></p><p>Content Research Report · Microsoft Copilot in Teams Meetings · 2026</p><p>Source: support.microsoft.com/en-us/teams/copilot</p></footer>
</div></body></html>
